cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SeqDesk in your work, please cite this software."
title: SeqDesk
abstract: >-
  SeqDesk is open-source software for sequencing facilities to manage orders,
  samples, standards-aware metadata, analysis workflows, and data submission.
